# Packages the SmartRoom repo carries as built elsewhere (too long a compile
# for the image build): sha256, two spaces, file name. smartroom/build-packages
# copies each from SMARTROOM_ROOM_PACKAGES only if it matches, and signs it
# with the SmartRoom package key like the packages it builds.
#
# chromium-smartroom 158.0.8127.36-3: Arch Linux ARM's Chromium with direct
# V4L2 decode and encode, built on a Mac Studio from the recipe in
# ludagoo/omarchy-mac-pkgs smartroom/pkgbuilds/chromium-smartroom (PKGBUILD,
# sr-*.patch, and BUILT, which names this file and its sha256). It conflicts
# with omarchy-chromium-bin and provides chromium and /usr/bin/chromium.
614a39d897240f3d94bd42667638e986d8253708eb44daf8c7d55483a4c2f680  chromium-smartroom-158.0.8127.36-3-aarch64.pkg.tar.xz
